-da9516e3970d" :activity/first-step "step-8ee2a0af-2eaa-5542-8abb-4d17722ea629"]] "retractions" [[17592186079219 :question/problem "The graph of $y = 4f(2x) - 3$, can be obtained from the graph of $y = f(x)$ by applying **some** of the following transformations:\n\n- $(T1)$ - Translate up by $3$ units\n- $(T2)$ - Stretch by a scale factor of $4$ parallel to the $y$-axis\n- $(T3)$ - Translate down by $3$ units\n- $(T4)$ - Stretch by a scale factor of $0.5$ parallel to the $x$-axis\n\nWhich of the following could be a possible ordering of the appropriate transformations?"] [17592186078092 :answer-field/choices 17592186078096] [17592186078092 :answer-field/choices 17592186078097] [17592186078092 :answer-field/choices 17592186078093] [17592186078092 :answer-field/choices 17592186078094] [17592186078092 :answer-field/choices 17592186078095]]}]